ue. The cloche changes location every 30 seconds. In order to win the match, a player needs to control the cloche until the percentage hits 100.</li></ul>","developers":["Seashell Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1113770/header.jpg?t=1690842454","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92019 Seashell Studio SAS de C.V.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1113770/458206/45b8d914d27cf2d40cbd1f26b9872367a475231f/1751190284/dash_av1.mpd?t=1690842448","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1113770/458206/45b8d914d27cf2d40cbd1f26b9872367a475231f/1751190284/dash_h264.mpd?t=1690842448","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1113770/458206/45b8d914d27cf2d40cbd1f26b9872367a475231f/1751190284/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1690842448","id":256883934,"name":"Tasty Tempura Treats","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256883934/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1690842448"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1113770/458205/1fe35279ef83a880392e07ae746d05dff93d5c22/1751190283/dash_av1.mpd?t=1690842452","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1113770/458205/1fe35279ef83a880392e07ae746d05dff93d5c22/1751190283/dash_h264.mpd?t=1690842452","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1113770/458205/1fe35279ef83a880392e07ae746d05dff93d5c22/1751190283/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1690842452","id":256883933,"name":"Cosmic Carbs Crusade","thumbnail":"https://shared.akama